+     and the zram sysfs ABI: <a href="https://kernel.org/doc/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-block-zram" data-bare-link="true">https://kernel.org/doc/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-block-zram</a></p>
+
+<p><code>fasteval</code> documentation for the entire <code>zram-size</code> arithmetic DSL: <a href="https://docs.rs/fasteval/0.2.4/fasteval/#the-fasteval-expression-mini-language" data-bare-link="true">https://docs.rs/fasteval/0.2.4/fasteval/#the-fasteval-expression-mini-language</a></p>
